# 1/8 repeats of a saw burst with P2 255 (-12 dB per repeat): the repeats die away; then P2 0 holds them, at 50/50
# dry/wet; a held G3 (1/8T) takes over at step 20.
tempo 140
steps 32
tail 0.5
track fx1
input saw 220 0.5
param p1 70
param p2 255
param pan 255
param level 255
gain 1
param p2 0 16
param pan 128 16
note 20 G3 8
expect sound 0 32
expect peak_below 0
